 modders, and players.**\n\n**Whether you're here to jump into custom player-built worlds or grind through story levels, there's a place for you here.**\n\n**Download Monke Fighters today and join the community where you belong!**", "short_description": "Welcome to Monke Fighters! This game is all about the community and the creators who help make it what it's truly meant to be. Whether it's playing custom maps built through mod.io or diving into progression like levelling up and beating story mode, this game is for you! Download the game now to join the community where you belong!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/monke-fighters-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "BrassVr", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://discord.gg/Nr9vYfVMae", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1327565540447788"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825503_1063538239966293_8230142135032970762_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oCmocKAWcS8Q7kNvwE79f1H&_nc_oc=Adoa__8y1IAI320ueFd3xD5EzcyC9LZc92IdPxD16TnFRAllb_QNF9FzTrma3SumaRk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculu